{"type":"excalidraw","version":2,"source":"hermes-agent","elements":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"bg1","x":-200,"y":-100,"width":1400,"height":2200,"fillStyle":"solid","backgroundColor":"#fafafa","strokeColor":"transparent"},{"type":"text","id":"t1","x":150,"y":50,"width":800,"height":60,"text":"WIREFRAME 1: Editorial / Minimal","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#1a1a2e","originalText":"WIREFRAME 1: Editorial / Minimal","autoResize":true},{"type":"text","id":"t2","x":150,"y":110,"width":900,"height":40,"text":"Hero (existing) → generous whitespace → typography-led content blocks","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#666","originalText":"Hero (existing) → generous whitespace → typography-led content blocks","autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","id":"r1","x":150,"y":200,"width":1000,"height":200,"roundness":{"type":3},"strokeColor":"#e0e0e0","strokeWidth":1,"backgroundColor":"transparent","boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"t_r1"}]},{"type":"text","id":"t_r1","x":180,"y":220,"width":940,"height":160,"text":"WHAT WE DO\nThree pillars, no fluff. Each gets a full-width statement + one metric.\n\nWeb Design  •  Sites that pull their weight  •  +520% engagement\nSocial Media  •  Content with gravitational pull  •  +340% traffic\nSEO / GEO  •  Found by the right people  •  #1 Local Pack","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#1a1a2e","originalText":"WHAT WE DO\nThree pillars, no fluff. Each gets a full-width statement + one metric.\n\nWeb Design  •  Sites that pull their weight  •  +520% engagement\nSocial Media  •  Content with gravitational pull  •  +340% traffic\nSEO / GEO  •  Found by the right people  •  #1 Local Pack","autoResize":true,"containerId":"r1","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"r2","x":150,"y":450,"width":480,"height":380,"roundness":{"type":3},"strokeColor":"#e0e0e0","strokeWidth":1,"backgroundColor":"transparent","boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"t_r2"}]},{"type":"text","id":"t_r2","x":180,"y":470,"width":420,"height":340,"text":"WORK\nCase study previews as editorial spreads.\n\n[Image area — Brookline Property Group]\nSocial-first listings → 38 leads/mo\n\n[Image area — Harrison McPhee Arboriculture]\nLocal SEO → #1 map pack\n\n[Image area — Holliston Agricultural Commission]\nCustom Astro build","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#1a1a2e","originalText":"WORK\nCase study previews as editorial spreads.\n\n[Image area — Brookline Property Group]\nSocial-first listings → 38 leads/mo\n\n[Image area — Harrison McPhee Arboriculture]\nLocal SEO → #1 map pack\n\n[Image area — Holliston Agricultural Commission]\nCustom Astro build","autoResize":true,"containerId":"r2","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"r3","x":670,"y":450,"width":480,"height":380,"roundness":{"type":3},"strokeColor":"#e0e0e0","strokeWidth":1,"backgroundColor":"#f5f5f5","fillStyle":"solid","boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"t_r3"}]},{"type":"text","id":"t_r3","x":700,"y":470,"width":420,"height":340,"text":"HOW IT WORKS\n01  Find the friction — a short call\n02  Make the plan — fixed-price roadmap\n03  Build the useful thing — ships fast\n04  Measure and refine — we track post-launch\n\nAutomation note: back-office workflows\nthat eat your week → custom code/AI","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#1a1a2e","originalText":"HOW IT WORKS\n01  Find the friction — a short call\n02  Make the plan — fixed-price roadmap\n03  Build the useful thing — ships fast\n04  Measure and refine — we track post-launch\n\nAutomation note: back-office workflows\nthat eat your week → custom code/AI","autoResize":true,"containerId":"r3","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rectangle","id":"r4","x":150,"y":880,"width":1000,"height":180,"roundness":{"type":3},"strokeColor":"#e63946","strokeWidth":2,"backgroundColor":"#1a1a2e","fillStyle":"solid","boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"t_r4"}]},{"type":"text","id":"t_r4","x":180,"y":900,"width":940,"height":140,"text":"START A PROJECT\nhello@crescentmoondesign.com\n\nTell us what's not working. We'll map a useful next step.\nBased in Portola, CA — working nationwide","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#f0ece2","originalText":"START A PROJECT\nhello@crescentmoondesign.com\n\nTell us what's not working. We'll map a useful next step.\nBased in Portola, CA — working nationwide","autoResize":true,"containerId":"r4","textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle"},{"type":"text","id":"t_note1","x":150,"y":1100,"width":900,"height":30,"text":"Visual language: large type, ample margins, single accent color (red), no cards with borders","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#888","originalText":"Visual language: large type, ample margins, single accent color (red), no cards with borders","autoResize":true}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff"}}